The moments is a list of 1, 4.
The span is 2.
The last is the last position of moments.
The total is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The here is item spot of moments.
The total is total plus span.
If spot is less than last.
The next is item (spot plus 1) of moments.
The covered is next minus here.
If covered is less than span, subtract span from total, add covered to total.

Show total.
